OL,3,GNEWSAMuslim convert used 'lads'
OL,4,Aholiday' chat to join IS
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 25-year-old man has admitted
OL,7,F"preparing terrorist acts" by trying to
OL,8,Fjoin the Islamic State (IS) group.
OL,10,FOliver William Rea, from Arnold in
OL,11,FNottinghamshire, is understood to be a
OL,12,FMuslim convert and was due to go on
OL,13,Ftrial at the Old Bailey.
OL,15,FBut it has emerged that Rea has now
OL,16,Fpleaded guilty to a detailed terrorism
OL,17,Fcharge, setting out how he planned to
OL,18,Fjoin IS.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
